{
 "id": "threads/two-sessions-same-change/main-and-subagent",
 "description": "Two sessions each have a main thread and a subagent called a:sub. All four report the same cmdfilter ChangeID on their own request, as the operator derives the same one for the same output. Each prices it once, as new on its own thread, +$0.02625, with no unique_change failure. ThreadKey is session plus thread, so neither the other session's main nor its a:sub reaches it. cg's MarkUnique keys by tenant, component and content, so only the first of the four is unique to it.",
